    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable equalrows=\"true\" equalcolumns=\"true\"><mtr><mtd/><mtd><msup><mrow/><mn>35</mn></msup><mi>CI</mi></mtd><mtd><msup><mrow/><mn>37</mn></msup><mi>CI</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>Molar</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>ratio</mi></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi>avg</mi></msub><mo>.</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>37</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>.5</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>35</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>37</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>37</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>.5</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.5</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So, ratio of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mrow/><mn>35</mn></msup><mi>CI</mi><msup><mo>:</mo><mn>37</mn></msup><mi>CI</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>",
